      },
      {
        "text": "Barbara Lee was among those voting.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "All 435 members of Congress were present during the vote.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Barbara Lee prepared herself before casting her vote by taking a deep breath.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
