    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "My dad called me. He was still alive, retired Lieutenant Colonel in the Army, and he was the first one that called, and he said, yep, that was the right vote. He said, we cannot commit to going to war. If you don't know where you're going and who you're going after, and if you're targeting correctly and what have you.",
